  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%98%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A7%80%EC%BC%9C%EC%A4%98/2100), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64042331)\n\nA fifth victim of a serial murder case occurs, and detectives find the only witness... Do Jun-hyeok, the witness, said he was the 3rd generation chaebol?\n\nWhile investigating his mother's death without his family's knowledge, Jun-hyeok found out that the man he encountered was a serial killer.\n\nThe moment when you feel like you're going crazy with the obsession of a strong detective like a first-year child,\n\nFace the real killer... !\n\nBut the killer disappeared without leaving any evidence. With no progress in the investigation and Jun-hyeok's personal protection, Hae-ra devises a plan to catch the killer using Jun-hyeok as bait.\n\nGoing to work disguised as a secretary for a third-generation conglomerate, you must protect him and catch the killer!",
